# Start from a sample book

A sample book is a finished book you can open, take apart and change. It is a quick way to see how a book is put together, or to start from something close to what you want.

1. On the [Books]{.ui} screen, click [Sample books…]{.ui}.
2. The window lists the books in [Essential Samples]{.ui}. To see more, choose [Extra Samples]{.ui} from the list at the top.
3. Click a book.

The book opens, ready to edit. It is your own copy: your changes do not affect the original, and it appears under [Your books]{.ui} like any book you make.
